@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 0. Login (Wajib 200 + token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "satnaing", "password": "widuri2026" }

### 1. Pipeline Status TANPA token (Wajib 401)
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/pipeline-status

### 2. Pipeline Status — empty state / run pertama (Wajib 200)
# run=null bila belum pernah ada preprocessing_run (Frame PRE-1D empty state).
GET {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/pipeline-status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 3. Pipeline Status per periode eksplisit (200; ?periodeId=)
GET {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/pipeline-status?periodeId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Source Preview rapor — raw values 18 mapel (Wajib 200; data: { total, page, limit, rows:[{nis,nama,values}] })
GET {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/source-preview?jenis=rapor&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Source Preview pts
GET {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/source-preview?jenis=pts&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Source Preview pas
GET {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/source-preview?jenis=pas&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Source Preview non_akademik (kosong tampil default "Tidak Ada"/"Tidak Mengikuti")
GET {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/source-preview?jenis=non_akademik&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Source Preview jenis tidak valid (Wajib 400 validasi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/source-preview?jenis=salah
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Jalankan Integrasi pada run AKTIF (Wajib 200; response = shape pipeline-status terbaru;
# integrated_data terisi, integrated_at + integrated_duration_ms teraudit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/integration
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Re-run Integrasi (Wajib 200; run lama -> SUPERSEDED, run BARU ACTIVE,
# stage Cleaning+Transformasi+Reduksi RESET sesuai matriks V-4)
POST {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/integration
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Integrasi pada periode tanpa siswa (Wajib 422 pesan Bahasa Indonesia)
# Ganti periodeId ke id periode yang belum ada siswanya.
POST {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/integration?periodeId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Verifikasi badge pasca-integrasi (integrasi SELESAI, cleaning MENUNGGU, transformasi/reduksi TERKUNCI)
GET {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/pipeline-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Cleaning Config — distribusi raw non-akademik + mapping L1 (identity pre-fill)
# + statistik missing akademik (BE-PRE-2). Wajib 200; data: { imputationMethod, fields[7], academicMissing[18] }
# Pra-syarat: jalankan Integrasi (#9) dulu agar integrated_data terisi.
GET {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/cleaning/config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Cleaning Config per periode eksplisit
GET {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/cleaning/config?periodeId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Jalankan Cleaning method MEAN + mapping L1 (Wajib 200; response = shape pipeline-status terbaru;
# cleaned_data terisi (missing akademik = rata-rata GLOBAL), category_mapping run aktif ter-replace,
# transformed_invalidated_at & reduced_invalidated_at terisi, rows transformed/reduced TERHAPUS (V-4))
POST {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/cleaning
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "imputationMethod": "mean",
  "mappings": {
    "jurusan_1": { "it": "Teknik Informatika", "si": "Sistem Informasi" },
    "ekstrakurikuler": { "pram": "Pramuka" }
  }
}

### 16. Cleaning method MEDIAN tanpa perubahan mapping (mapping lama tetap tersimpan; Wajib 200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/cleaning
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "imputationMethod": "median", "mappings": {} }

### 17. Cleaning method MODE (Wajib 200; mode seri unik -> sel missing tetap null, didokumentasikan)
POST {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/cleaning
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "imputationMethod": "mode" }

### 18. Cleaning dengan imputationMethod tidak valid (Wajib 400 Zod: "Metode imputasi harus mean, median, atau mode")
POST {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/cleaning
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "imputationMethod": "random" }

### 19. Cleaning TANPA integrasi selesai (Wajib 400 Bahasa Indonesia; pakai periode yang belum di-integrasi)
POST {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/cleaning?periodeId=2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "imputationMethod": "mean", "mappings": {} }

### 20. Verifikasi badge pasca-cleaning (cleaning SELESAI; transformasi/reduksi TERKUNCI krn prasyarat blm SELESAI;
# setelah re-run integration hilir akan tampil RESET sesuai matriks V-4)
GET {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/pipeline-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 21. Transform Config — kamus bidang L2 + assignedValues + unmapped (BE-PRE-3)
# Lazy seed: GET config PERDANA menyisipkan seluruh KAMUS_BIDANG ke category_option periode ini
# (cek: SELECT * FROM category_option WHERE periode_id=...). Pra-syarat: Cleaning SELESAI (#15),
# else 400 Bahasa Indonesia. data: { fields[7]: { fieldName, options[{id,name,code,assignedValues}], unmapped[] } }
GET {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/transform/config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 22. Transform Config per periode eksplisit
GET {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/transform/config?periodeId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 23. Buat Bidang Kamus TANPA code -> code default = max(code)+1 per (periode,field) (Wajib 201;
# TIDAK invalidate hilir — buat bidang tanpa assignment = no-op bagi transformed/reduced)
POST {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/transform/options
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "fieldName": "ekstrakurikuler", "name": "Keagamaan" }

### 24. Buat Bidang Kamus dengan code eksplisit (Wajib 201 selama unik per periode+field)
POST {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/transform/options
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "fieldName": "prestasi", "name": "Debat", "code": 6 }

### 25. Duplikat name (periode,field,name) -> Wajib 422 Bahasa Indonesia
POST {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/transform/options
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "fieldName": "ekstrakurikuler", "name": "Olahraga" }

### 26. Duplikat code (periode,field,code) -> Wajib 422 Bahasa Indonesia (V-3: kode create-only,
# ganti kode = DELETE #28 lalu POST lagi; TIDAK ada endpoint update)
POST {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/transform/options
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "fieldName": "ekstrakurikuler", "name": "Bidang Baru", "code": 2 }

### 27. Mapping L2: petakan nilai standar -> bidang (upsert unique periode+field+standard_value).
# Ganti id option dgn id hasil #21 (data.fields[].options[].id).
# JIKA transformed_data run aktif ADA -> invalidasi V-4: DELETE transformed+reduced,
# kedua flag invalidated terisi -> badge Transformasi & Reduksi RESET (downstreamInvalidated=true).
POST {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/transform/assignments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "fieldName": "ekstrakurikuler", "optionId": 2, "standardValues": ["Pramuka", "Olimpiade Matematika"] }

### 28. Hapus Bidang Kamus (trash) -> assignment cascade hilang, nilai balik ke unmapped.
# Ganti :id dengan id opsi riil dari #21. Jika transformed_data ada -> V-4 (kedua badge RESET).
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/transform/options/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 29. Jalankan Transformasi — Gate: cleaning SELESAI (else 400); unmapped kosong (else 422 + daftar unmapped di data.unmapped).
# Encode 7 non-akademik via assignment->code, Min-Max 25 kolom Decimal(8,4) lintas seluruh siswa
# (kolom konstan -> 0, ruling V-2). Re-run delete+insert satu transaksi. Sukses -> transformed_at +
# transformed_duration_ms terisi, transformed_invalidated_at & reduced_invalidated_at DI-CLEAR
# (Reduksi jadi MENUNGGU, bukan RESET). Response = shape pipeline-status terbaru.
POST {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/transform/run
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 30. Verifikasi badge pasca-transformasi (transformasi SELESAI; reduksi MENUNGGU; oracle: bandingkan
# transformed_data vs workbook sheet "Transformation Normalisasi" toleransi ±0.005 min 3 kolom)
GET {{baseUrl}}/preprocessing/pipeline-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
